<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Configuration Management</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/config/style.css"></head><body data-console-build="233-nav2" data-page="packages">
<header><strong id="environment">CONFIG</strong><span>Configuration Management · Integration Server</span></header><div class="shell"><aside><h2>Configuration</h2><a data-ajax="false" target="_self" data-nav="packages" href="/config/packages.dsp">Packages</a><a data-ajax="false" target="_self" data-nav="files" href="/config/files.dsp">Files</a><a data-ajax="false" target="_self" data-nav="encrypted" href="/config/encrypted.dsp">Encrypted Values</a><h2>Settings</h2><a data-ajax="false" target="_self" data-nav="settings" href="/config/settings.dsp">Server Cache</a></aside><main><div class="breadcrumb">Configuration &gt; Packages</div><div id="notice" role="status">Connecting to Integration Server…</div>
<section data-view="packages"><h3>Packages</h3><div class="panel"><button id="refresh">Re-scan package directories</button><p class="hint">Packages and common filenames follow manager.properties discovery settings. Select Files to view existing files across all matching packages.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Package</th><th>Location</th><th>Files</th><th>Encrypted Values</th></tr></thead><tbody id="packageRows"></tbody></table></div></section>
<div id="selector" class="row hidden"><div><label for="package">Package</label><select id="package"></select></div></div>
<section data-view="files"><h3>Configuration Files</h3><div class="panel"><div class="row"><div><label for="file">File</label><select id="file"></select></div><button id="open">View / Edit</button><input id="newFile" placeholder="config.cnf" aria-label="New file name"><button id="create">Create configuration file</button></div><p class="hint">All matching packages lists existing configured common files. Select a package to manage all of its configuration files. Save writes disk only.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Package</th><th>Location</th><th>File</th><th>Stage</th></tr></thead><tbody id="fileRows"></tbody></table></div></section>
<div id="editor" class="hidden"><h3 id="filePath">Edit File</h3><div class="panel"><textarea id="content" aria-label="Configuration source" spellcheck="false"></textarea><p><button id="save" class="primary" disabled>Save file</button> <span class="hint">Runtime values change after Reload Configuration.</span></p><details><summary>Add / update encrypted value</summary><p class="hint">Writes [[encrypted:handle]] to this file and AES-GCM ciphertext to config.secrets.cnf. Properties formatting/comments are rewritten. Existing edited text must be saved first.</p><div class="row"><div><label for="key">Configuration key</label><input id="key"></div><div><label for="handle">Encrypted handle (optional)</label><input id="handle"></div><div><label for="secret">New value</label><input id="secret" type="password" autocomplete="new-password"></div><button id="saveSecret">Encrypt and save</button></div></details></div></div>
<section data-view="encrypted"><h3>Encrypted Values · Selected Package</h3><div class="panel"><p class="hint">Select a package to list its references and stored handles from the loaded JVM snapshot. Reload Configuration to discover saved file changes. Add or update a value directly. Save writes the encrypted store only; Reload Configuration activates changes.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Package</th><th>Handle</th><th>Status</th><th>File / Key</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody id="secretRows"></tbody></table><div id="secretEditPanel" class="panel hidden"><h3 id="secretEditTitle">Edit encrypted value</h3><label for="secretEditValue">New secret value</label><input id="secretEditValue" type="password" autocomplete="new-password"><button id="secretEditSave">Encrypt and save</button><button id="secretEditCancel">Cancel</button><p>Existing plaintext is never displayed. Reload Configuration after saving.</p></div></div></section>
<section data-view="migration"><h3>Configuration files</h3><div class="panel"><p>Manage properties directly in config.cnf and config-&lt;environment&gt;.cnf. Add encrypted values through the Encrypted Values page.</p><a href="/config/files.dsp">Open configuration files</a></div></section>
<section data-view="settings"><h3>Server Cache</h3><div class="panel"><p>Loaded at: <span id="loadedAt"></span></p><p>Configuration version:</p><p id="version"></p><button id="reset" class="primary">Reload Configuration + Reset Service Cache</button><p class="hint">Environment/global-package options are in packages/config/config/manager.properties. Edit on disk, then reset. Each IS node has its own cache. Decrypted-secret caching is disabled by default.</p></div></section>
<p class="hint spacer">Save → disk only. Reload / startup → JVM snapshot. Runtime values come from the loaded config files.</p></main></div><script src="/config/console-bootstrap.js?v=233-nav2"></script><noscript>Enable JavaScript to load configuration data from Integration Server.</noscript></body></html>